      "writtenOn": "2026-10-26T07:07:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This now emits 120.0 instead of 120. Suggested approach: keep integer JSON output, for example by converting back to int64_t when the value is integral, or by using a helper that returns a variant. Also, for an unrecognised sensor_data_size the keys were previously omitted and are now null. Please either keep omitting them or report an error, so a malformed PDR cannot be mistaken for a valid one.",
      "revId": "bfe98e0646802722fdd50d90aaf38a24f6c4f705",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
